    "description": "Natural Crystal Geode Specimens Lot - 2 Pieces\nAmethyst and Quartz Mineral Displays\nThis pair of natural mineral specimens showcases distinct crystal formations. The lot includes a purple amethyst crystal cluster featuring sharp terminations over a natural rock matrix, alongside a hollow quartz geode half lined with sparkling crystalline druzy. These natural geological display pieces make striking accents for any mineral collection, study, or home decor setting.\nItems Included:\nPurple Amethyst Specimen: Natural cluster of lilac to violet quartz crystal points with exposed rough matrix and celadonite basalt backing\nQuartz Geode Half: Hollow geode specimen with a rough tan exterior rind opening into an interior cavity lined with clear and white quartz crystals\nCondition:\nNatural geological specimens in raw, unpolished condition. Both pieces display natural crystalline formations, textural variations, and rough matrix edges with no visible artificial repairs or enhancements.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
